      "object_role": "synthesis",
      "proposed_content": "The exponent-two partition function sits at the freezing boundary: low fractional moments expose a typical scale below its global mean, while multiscale Euler-product barriers isolate the high-probability trajectories on which the imported critical-chaos estimate supplies the square-root log-log saving.",
